{"title":"2006 Cyprus Seniors Provincial/2nd grade/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_Seniors_Provincial/2nd_grade/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/d/cdd4bd55873f70b160514d46179e4f9adc72ead8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\alpha, \\beta, \\gamma \\in \\mathbb{R}- \\{0\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"133\" height=\"18\" /> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/f/81fcd847dee9bb718f051b8755634804dcbbaa44.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\alpha + \\beta + \\gamma = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"110\" height=\"16\" />, prove that\n</p><p>i) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc61a8af6d3cd40fe3b046a7c15458d354bb1fb1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\alpha^2 + \\beta^2 - \\gamma^2 = -2(\\beta + \\gamma)(\\alpha + \\gamma)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"262\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p>ii) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/0/660bea01e7a8614d098f6d7df706ca6c70e9166a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{\\beta^2 + \\gamma^2 - \\alpha^2} + \\frac{1}{\\gamma^2 + \\alpha^2 - \\beta^2} + \\frac{1}{\\alpha^2 + \\beta^2 - \\gamma^2} = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"389\" height=\"40\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_Seniors_Provincial/2nd_grade/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>i) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/1/9d174f12ee1f2f4d3fb18cd2590cd494625c7bab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\alpha + \\beta + \\gamma)^2 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"132\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/3/cf33a55f0fe9f0b18928a7a046cb6d4c8580fe9b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\alpha^2 + \\beta^2 - \\gamma^2 +2\\gamma^2 -2\\alpha\\beta -2\\beta\\gamma -2\\alpha\\gamma = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"342\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/b/f2baed970c5d2f1d3d413f854d05ad32cb606b6e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\alpha^2 + \\beta^2 - \\gamma^2 = 2(\\gamma^2 -\\alpha\\beta -\\beta\\gamma -\\alpha\\gamma)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"297\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc61a8af6d3cd40fe3b046a7c15458d354bb1fb1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\alpha^2 + \\beta^2 - \\gamma^2 = -2(\\beta + \\gamma)(\\alpha + \\gamma)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"262\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p>ii) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/d/33d5f2a0a860520e73bdcb0de2c57804b736cb51.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2(\\alpha + \\beta + \\gamma) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"134\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/c/57c2faa96bfc592b9e8232549c32402ca2f8b093.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\alpha + \\beta) + (\\alpha + \\gamma) + (\\beta + \\gamma)= 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"253\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/d/20d6d854e4ad08c473db6701dc0d7d3d413ea900.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\alpha + \\beta}{-2(\\alpha + \\beta)(\\beta + \\gamma)(\\alpha + \\gamma)} + \\frac{\\alpha + \\gamma}{-2(\\alpha + \\beta)(\\beta + \\gamma)(\\alpha + \\gamma)} + \\frac{\\beta + \\gamma}{-2(\\alpha + \\beta)(\\beta + \\gamma)(\\alpha + \\gamma)} = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"686\" height=\"42\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/0/6a0ff8359c7e685b6af6f75ccd5f3a77004fad1f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{-2(\\beta + \\gamma)(\\alpha + \\gamma)} + \\frac{1}{-2(\\alpha + \\beta)(\\beta + \\gamma)} + \\frac{1}{-2(\\alpha + \\beta)(\\alpha + \\gamma)} = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"510\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p>Form part i) it becomes\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/0/660bea01e7a8614d098f6d7df706ca6c70e9166a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{\\beta^2 + \\gamma^2 - \\alpha^2} + \\frac{1}{\\gamma^2 + \\alpha^2 - \\beta^2} + \\frac{1}{\\alpha^2 + \\beta^2 - \\gamma^2} = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"389\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<hr />\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_Seniors_Provincial/2nd_grade/Problem_2\" title=\"2006 Cyprus Seniors Provincial/2nd grade/Problem 2\">Next Problem</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_Seniors_Provincial/2nd_grade\" title=\"2006 Cyprus Seniors Provincial/2nd grade\">Back to Exam</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_Seniors_Provincial/2nd_grade/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Cyprus_Seniors_Provincial_competition\" title=\"Cyprus Seniors Provincial competition\">Cyprus Seniors Provincial competition</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Cyprus_Seniors_Provincial_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"Cyprus Seniors Provincial Problems and Solutions\">Cyprus Seniors Provincial Problems and Solutions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_competition_resources\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mathematics competition resources\">Mathematics competition resources</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 